<p class="toys-lead">Small live simulations and visual toys that run in the page, each one a tag of
its own - a file of <code>pad/subs/toys/types/</code> in the engine, written
<code>{open/}toy 'name'/{close/}</code>, as <code>{open/}toy:name/{close/}</code> or, when nothing
else has the name, bare. The server checks the options, a script in the page runs the toy: draw on
it, drag it, click it, change its sliders.</p>

<ul class="toys-cards">
  {toys}
  <li><a class="toys-card" href="?{$toy}"><b>{$name}</b><span>{$line}</span><code>{open/}{$toy}/{close/}</code></a></li>
  {/toys}
</ul>
